=== Len_2H_01 ===
As you walk towards the lake, you notice Lena in her usual spot, laying down with eyes closed. #speaker:none #emotion:none
Is that you, Ari? Thought my shift started later tonight... #speaker:Lena #emotion:neutral
No wait, it's not Ari. Ari would've been mid-lecture by now. #speaker:Lena #emotion:happy
Lena peeks over at you, making the least amount of effort possible in seeing who disturbed her. #speaker:none #emotion:none
\*player*, what a welcome surprise. #speaker:Lena #emotion:happy
What brings you over to the forest? Seems like quite the walk from your farm. #emotion:happy
*   [Fishing]
    Just thought that I'd do some fishing while I've got the time. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Ugh... you and just about everyone else. #speaker:Lena #emotion:annoyed #relation_pts:Lena/+1
    I swear, you'd think that this is the only spot in the settlement to fish anymore.
    Well actually Lena, it kind of is the only spot if you're fishing for lakewater fish such as some bass or sturgeon. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Hmm... fair point. #speaker:Lena #emotion:neutral
    Alright fine, you can fish here. Just don't disturb me too much while I'm meditating, yeah? #emotion:happy
    If you do, I'll make sure to throw you in the lake with your precious sturgeon.
    -> DONE
*   [Foraging]
    Just out here to grab some herbs. Maybe some flowers. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Ooh, very nice, *player*. #speaker:Lena #emotion:happy #relation_pts:Lena/2
    You can really make some awesome food with the herbs around here.
    Just make sure you don't pick anything toxic. Lots of toxic berries around here. #emotion:neutral
    And if you're looking for flowers, you might not find too many around.
    Yours truly already picked some, plus Arno and sometimes even Bryan grabs some too. #emotion:happy
    Really? Bryan? Carpenter Bryan? #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Yup, that's the guy. Doesn't seem like the flower type, does he? #speaker:Lena #emotion:happy
    Lotta people in this town still have their layers, even if we're a lot less people than back on Earth. #emotion:neutral
    I'm sure eventually you'll see. Just give people time to open up to you. #emotion:happy
    -> DONE
*   [Lumber]
    Well the farm is running low on lumber, so I thought I'd grab some from here since there's plenty of trees to go around. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Umm, no. If you're gonna make a bunch of noise, go and do it somewhere else. #speaker:Lena #relation_pts:Lena/-2
    And actually, why do you need wood in the first place? You're a farmer, not a carpenter. Stop cutting down trees just because. #emotion:neutral
    I just craft some things locally on the farm. Lot easier that way. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Well I don't care. Last thing this forest needs is another person taking what they want from it... #speaker:Lena #emotion:annoyed relation_pts:Lena/-2
    ... #speaker:none #emotion:none
    Sorry, *player*. I didn't mean to lash out at you. #speaker:Lena #emotion:sad
    But I've read about how you guys treated Earth in the past.
    I just don't want that to happen here on Raea too. #emotion:neutral
    -> DONE
    
-   Well... whatever. #speaker:Lena #emotion:neutral
Whatever you're gonna do, just make sure you're not gonna bother me.
Or if you want, you can join me and meditate a bit.
It's a good way to take a break from the hustle and bustle of daily life, y'know? #emotion:happy
Actually, I think I'll take you up on that. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
Really? Huh... was not expecting you to actually accept. #speaker:Lena #emotion:neutral
Well, take a seat then. #emotion:happy
And if you don't mind, I tend to be silent when I'm meditating. #emotion:neutral
You take a seat next to Lena, and spend quite a bit of time just taking in the sights and sounds. #speaker:none #emotion:none
As you reflect on your time on Raea, you realize that you haven't really had a chance to take in all that has happened.
How you haven't had time to process, much less grieve, your fellow crewmates that you never got to see again.
As you process your thoughts and emotions, you aren't sure how much time has passed...
-> END

